WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.830
<v Krista>In this video, we're talking about addition</v>

2
00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:04.350
and subtraction of radical terms,

3
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.540
and what we've been asked to do

4
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.340
is simplify the radical expressions.

5
00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.040
So we're talking about expressions,

6
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:09.873
not equations.

7
00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:10.830
There's no equal sign,

8
00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.230
so we're dealing with an expression,

9
00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:13.960
and we call it a radical expression

10
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.880
because there are radical signs involved,

11
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.290
or square root signs involved.

12
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.570
So in this first example here,

13
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.490
we have four times the square root of two

14
00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.490
minus six times the square root of two

15
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.600
