no multiplication or division.

19
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.580
So when you have addition and subtraction

20
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:34.230
of square root signs,

21
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.500
how do you simplify?

22
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.920
Well what you're looking for is like terms.

