00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.030
You're looking for the square roots to be the same.

24
00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.350
If the square roots are the same,

25
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.880
then you can combine the terms as like terms.

26
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.480
So what I need to look at here is my square roots,

