00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.570
and I have square root of two.

30
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:53.403
In other words,

31
00:00:53.403 --> 00:00:54.310
these three are all the same.

32
00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:55.200
They're like terms.

33
00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.360
So that means I can combine them.

