00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:10.470
minus six square root of twos

41
00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.350
plus 13 square root of twos.

42
00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:14.810
Or we could say we have four orange boxes,

43
00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.560
we take away six orange boxes,

