00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:18.730
and then we add back 13 orange boxes.

45
00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:20.350
How many orange boxes do we have?

46
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.970
So don't get confused by the fact

47
00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.290
that these are square roots.

48
00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.440
Just identify which ones are the same,

